dates go_error_type v1
description "A date with the alias koyomi_error. The Go code declares KoyomiError, the type of its errors, and the date's function is KoyomiError too, so the Go code does not compile (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date koyomi_error = received
  + 30 days
